{"id":"mahabharata-7-030","work":"mahabharata","part":7,"partName":"द्रोणपर्व","partNameEn":"Drona Parva","unit":30,"title":"त्रिंशत्तमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 30 · Ashvatthaman and Arjuna","summary":{"en":"With the Kaurava lines broken by Arjuna, the Pandavas stand firm and shake the Kaurava army. Drona's son faces Arjuna on one side while Arjuna destroys the rest of the Samshaptakas and Narayanas.","kn":"ಅರ್ಜುನನಿಂದ ಕೌರವ ಸಾಲುಗಳು ಒಡೆದಾಗ ಪಾಂಡವರು ದೃಢವಾಗಿ ನಿಂತು ಕೌರವ ಸೈನ್ಯವನ್ನು ಅಲುಗಿಸುತ್ತಾರೆ. ಅಶ್ವತ್ಥಾಮ ಒಂದು ಕಡೆ ಅರ್ಜುನನನ್ನು ಎದುರಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ; ಅರ್ಜುನ ಉಳಿದ ಸಂಶಪ್ತಕ, ನಾರಾಯಣರನ್ನು ನಾಶಮಾಡುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"अर्जुन से कौरव पंक्तियाँ टूटने पर पाण्डव डटकर कौरव सेना को हिला देते हैं। एक ओर अश्वत्थामा अर्जुन का सामना करता है और अर्जुन बचे हुए संशप्तकों और नारायणों का नाश करते हैं।","te":"అర్జునునిచే కౌరవ వరుసలు విరిగాక పాండవులు దృఢంగా నిలిచి కౌరవసేనను కుదిపేస్తారు. అశ్వత్థామ ఒకవైపు అర్జునుని ఎదుర్కొంటాడు; అర్జునుడు మిగిలిన సంశప్తక, నారాయణులను నాశనం చేస్తాడు.","ta":"அர்ஜுனனால் கௌரவ அணிகள் உடைய, பாண்டவர் உறுதியாக நின்று கௌரவப் படையை உலுக்குகின்றனர். அஸ்வத்தாமன் ஒருபுறம் அர்ஜுனனை எதிர்க்க, அர்ஜுனன் எஞ்சிய சம்சப்தக, நாராயணரை அழிக்கிறான்.","ml":"അർജുനൻ കൗരവ നിരകൾ തകർത്തതോടെ പാണ്ഡവർ ഉറച്ചുനിന്ന് കൗരവ സേനയെ ഇളക്കുന്നു. ഒരു ഭാഗത്ത് ദ്രോണരുടെ പുത്രൻ അർജുനനെ നേരിടുമ്പോൾ, അർജുനൻ ശേഷിച്ച സംശപ്തകരെയും നാരായണരെയും നശിപ്പിക്കുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 7.30; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Sep 22 2026","sections":[{"title":"संशप्तकवधपर्व","titleEn":"Samshaptakavadha Parva (Slaying of the Samshaptakas)","verses":[{"text":"धृतराष्ट्र उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Dhritarashtra said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"तेष्वनीकेषु भग्नेषु पाण्डुपुत्रेण संजय ।\nचलितानां द्रुतानां च कथमासीन्मनो हि वः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya, when those divisions were broken by the Pandava, what were your minds like, as they wavered and fled?"}},{"n":2,"text":"अनीकानां प्रभग्नानां व्यवस्थानमपश्यताम् ।\nदुष्करं प्रतिसंधानं तन्ममाचक्ष्व संजय ॥","meaning":{"en":"Tell me about those broken divisions who saw no way to hold the line; to rally them again was hard."}},{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":3,"text":"तथापि तव पुत्रस्य प्रियकामा विशां पते ।\nयशः प्रवीरा लोकेषु रक्षन्तो द्रोणमन्वयुः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Even so, wishing to please your son, the best heroes, protecting their fame in the world, followed Drona."}},{"n":4,"text":"समुद्यतेषु शस्त्रेषु संप्राप्ते च युधिष्ठिरे ।\nअकुर्वन्नार्यकर्माणि भैरवे सत्यभीतवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Though weapons were raised and Yudhishthira had arrived, they did the work of noble men in that fearful moment, as if truly afraid."}},{"n":5,"text":"अन्तरं भीमसेनस्य प्रापतन्नमितौजसः ।\nसात्यकेश्चैव शूरस्य धृष्टद्युम्नस्य चाभिभो ॥","meaning":{"en":"O mighty king, they found an opening against the boundlessly strong Bhimasena, brave Satyaki and Dhrishtadyumna."}},{"n":6,"text":"द्रोणं द्रोणमिति क्रूराः पाञ्चालाः समचोदयन् ।\nमा द्रोणमिति पुत्रास्ते कुरून्सर्वानचोदयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The cruel Panchalas urged on, \"Drona! Drona!\" and your sons urged all the Kurus, \"Not Drona!\""}},{"n":7,"text":"द्रोणं द्रोणमिति ह्येके मा द्रोणमिति चापरे ।\nकुरूणां पाण्डवानां च द्रोणद्यूतमवर्तत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Some said \"Drona! Drona!\" and others \"Not Drona!\" So a gambling match, with Drona as the stake, went on between the Kurus and Pandavas."}},{"n":8,"text":"यं यं स्म भजते द्रोणः पाञ्चालानां रथव्रजम् ।\nतत्र तत्र स्म पाञ्चाल्यो धृष्टद्युम्नोऽथ धीयते ॥","meaning":{"en":"Whichever group of Panchala chariots Drona went toward, there the Panchala Dhrishtadyumna was placed against him."}},{"n":9,"text":"यथाभागविपर्यासे संग्रामे भैरवे सति ।\nवीराः समासदन्वीरानगच्छन्भीरवः परान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"In that fearful battle, where the usual positions were reversed, heroes met heroes and cowards went against enemies."}},{"n":10,"text":"अकम्पनीयाः शत्रूणां बभूवुस्तत्र पाण्डवाः ।\nअकम्पयंस्त्वनीकानि स्मरन्तः क्लेशमात्मनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"There the Pandavas became unshakable to their foes, and, remembering their own sufferings, shook the divisions."}},{"n":11,"text":"ते त्वमर्षवशं प्राप्ता ह्रीमन्तः सत्त्वचोदिताः ।\nत्यक्त्वा प्राणान्न्यवर्तन्त घ्नन्तो द्रोणं महाहवे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Overcome by anger, full of shame and urged on by courage, they gave up their lives and turned back, striking Drona in that great battle."}},{"n":12,"text":"अयसामिव संपातः शिलानामिव चाभवत् ।\nदीव्यतां तुमुले युद्धे प्राणैरमिततेजसाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"It was like a clash of iron on iron, rock on rock, as those of boundless fire played with their lives in that tumultuous fight."}},{"n":13,"text":"न तु स्मरन्ति संग्राममपि वृद्धास्तथाविधम् ।\nदृष्टपूर्वं महाराज श्रुतपूर्वमथापि वा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Even old men do not remember any battle of that kind, O great king, seen or heard before."}},{"n":14,"text":"प्राकम्पतेव पृथिवी तस्मिन्वीरावसादने ।\nप्रवर्तता बलौघेन महता भारपीडिता ॥","meaning":{"en":"The earth, crushed by the great flood of the army advancing, seemed to tremble in that slaughter of heroes."}},{"n":15,"text":"घूर्णतो हि बलौघस्य दिवं स्तब्ध्वेव निस्वनः ।\nअजातशत्रोः क्रुद्धस्य पुत्रस्य तव चाभवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"As the army surged, the noise of the furious sons of Ajatashatru and your own seemed to stop heaven itself."}},{"n":16,"text":"समासाद्य तु पाण्डूनामनीकानि सहस्रशः ।\nद्रोणेन चरता संख्ये प्रभग्नानि शितैः शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"When Drona, ranging in battle, had broken the Pandava divisions by thousands with sharp arrows, and was crushing them, that marvelous worker,"}},{"n":17,"text":"तेषु प्रमथ्यमानेषु द्रोणेनाद्भुतकर्मणा ।\nपर्यवारयदासाद्य द्रोणं सेनापतिः स्वयम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"their commander, Dhrishtadyumna himself, approached Drona and surrounded him."}},{"n":18,"text":"तदद्भुतमभूद्युद्धं द्रोणपाञ्चाल्ययोस्तदा ।\nनैव तस्योपमा काचित्संभवेदिति मे मतिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The battle between Drona and the Panchala was marvelous then; I think nothing could be compared with it."}},{"n":19,"text":"ततो नीलोऽनलप्रख्यो ददाह कुरुवाहिनीम् ।\nशरस्फुलिङ्गश्चापार्चिर्दहन्कक्षमिवानलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Nila, bright as fire, burned the Kuru army, with arrows as his sparks and bow as his flame, like a fire burning dry grass."}},{"n":20,"text":"तं दहन्तमनीकानि द्रोणपुत्रः प्रतापवान् ।\nपूर्वाभिभाषी सुश्लक्ष्णं स्मयमानोऽभ्यभाषत ॥","meaning":{"en":"As he burned the divisions, the mighty son of Drona, first to speak, smiling, spoke gently to him."}},{"n":21,"text":"नील किं बहुभिर्दग्धैस्तव योधैः शरार्चिषा ।\nमयैकेन हि युध्यस्व क्रुद्धः प्रहर चाशुगैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Nila, what use is it to burn many of your warriors with the flames of your arrows? Fight me alone; strike me angrily with swift arrows.\""}},{"n":22,"text":"तं पद्मनिकराकारं पद्मपत्रनिभेक्षणम् ।\nव्याकोशपद्माभमुखं नीलो विव्याध सायकैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Nila, with his face like a lotus and eyes like lotus petals, pierced that lotus-like face with arrows, bright as an open lotus."}},{"n":23,"text":"तेनातिविद्धः सहसा द्रौणिर्भल्लैः शितैस्त्रिभिः ।\nधनुर्ध्वजं च छत्रं च द्विषतः स न्यकृन्तत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Pierced by him, Drona's son suddenly cut down his enemy's bow, banner and umbrella with three sharp broad-headed arrows."}},{"n":24,"text":"सोत्प्लुत्य स्यन्दनात्तस्मान्नीलश्चर्मवरासिधृक् ।\nद्रोणायनेः शिरः कायाद्धर्तुमैच्छत्पतत्रिवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Nila leapt from that chariot, holding shield and fine sword, and wished to take Drona's son's head from his body like a bird."}},{"n":25,"text":"तस्योद्यतासेः सुनसं शिरः कायात्सकुण्डलम् ।\nभल्लेनापाहरद्द्रौणिः स्मयमान इवानघ ॥","meaning":{"en":"As he raised his sword, Drona's son, almost smiling, cut off his head with its fine nose and earrings with a broad-headed arrow, O sinless one."}},{"n":26,"text":"संपूर्णचन्द्राभमुखः पद्मपत्रनिभेक्षणः ।\nप्रांशुरुत्पलगर्भाभो निहतो न्यपतत्क्षितौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"With a face like the full moon and eyes like lotus petals, tall and radiant like the heart of a lotus, he fell dead to the ground."}},{"n":27,"text":"ततः प्रविव्यथे सेना पाण्डवी भृशमाकुला ।\nआचार्यपुत्रेण हते नीले ज्वलिततेजसि ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the Pandava army, greatly confused, trembled when Nila of blazing splendor was killed by the teacher's son."}},{"n":28,"text":"अचिन्तयंश्च ते सर्वे पाण्डवानां महारथाः ।\nकथं नो वासविस्त्रायाच्छत्रुभ्य इति मारिष ॥","meaning":{"en":"All the great warriors of the Pandavas thought: \"How will Indra's son save us from our enemies?\""}},{"n":29,"text":"दक्षिणेन तु सेनायाः कुरुते कदनं बली ।\nसंशप्तकावशेषस्य नारायणबलस्य च ॥","meaning":{"en":"For the mighty Arjuna was making slaughter on the south side of the army, among the remnant of the Samshaptakas and the Narayana force."}}]}]}